# Kid privacy (always)

Jacob is a minor. This public site must stay free of identifying details beyond the approved brand name **Jacob Tindall**.

## Never add to the site, git, or commit messages

- School name, grade, teachers, or class schedules
- Home address, neighborhood, or exact location
- Phone numbers, family emails, or dates of birth
- Friends’ names, photos of other minors, or family photos without parent approval
- Gamertags, Xbox/PSN/Epic IDs, Discord, or friend lists
- Travel plans, “I will be at…”, or live location

Fortnite and Minecraft may be mentioned as hobbies **without** account names.

## Do not add these features unless Jeff explicitly asks

- Comment systems, chat, user accounts, or visitor sign-in
- Contact forms that store submissions
- Analytics, ads, or tracking pixels
- Maps that pin a home or school

Contact stays a **mailto** to `SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL` from `.env` (parent-managed). Never commit the real email.

## Photos

Only images Jacob and a parent are comfortable sharing, under `public/images/`. No other people’s kids.
